The File Manager is an OPEN LOOK(tm) 1.0 application that enables you to view and manipulate UNIX(r) File System directories and files within the OPEN LOOK environment.  It provides an easy-to-use interface to activities such as: creating, deleting, copying, moving, and renaming directories and files.  To learn more about the individual functions move the mouse pointer to one of the specific visual interface elements within the File Manager, such as the File buttonstack or the Directory caption, and press HELP.
